OL,3,GNEWSAStormont speaker Edwin Poots warns
OL,4,AMLAs over language used in debates
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the Northern Ireland
OL,7,FAssembly have received an official
OL,8,Freprimand over the "aggressive tone and
OL,9,Flanguage" of recent debates.
OL,11,FThe Speaker Edwin Poots has written to
OL,12,Fsome of them about what he says have
OL,13,Fbeen the most serious incidents of
OL,14,Fconduct.
OL,16,FIn a letter to all MLAs, he claims "the
OL,17,Fstate of relationships and conduct"
OL,18,Facross the chamber presents a
OL,19,F"significant risk to business".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
