OL,3,GNEWSAStormont speaker Edwin Poots warns
OL,4,AMLAs over language used in debates
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the letter published by the Stormont
OL,7,Fauthorities, he writes "while I have a
OL,8,Fhigh threshold for passionate debate, I
OL,9,Fam concerned about the aggressive tone
OL,10,Fand language of some exchanges of
OL,11,Flate".
